            "review_title": "Review at The Shamrock Irish Pub",
            "review_text": "LaLaK\nToronto, Canada838 contributions\n0\nThis place is GREAT!\nMar 2023 • Couples\nAwesome place. Plays live music each night at 7pm. Most nights it’s outside as the weather is usually great. Always attracts people as they walk by. Clean facilities and decent food. The menu is quite large and I’ve attached it for viewing. The staff is absolutely amazing here, they are the main reason we kept going back. I dined there or had drinks multiple times in my travels. Met wonderful people from around the world too. A shout out to one man in particular named An. He’s such a great person, always so welcoming and friendly. Chatted with him each time I was there but also whenever I happened to walk by. He was always happy to offer advice for Da Nang and talk about our lives, music and travel. Don’t hesitate going here for a really enjoyable memorable evening.\nRead more\nWritten March 15, 2023",
